[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4021.829, "timestamp": "01:07:01", "text": "就像有点偏离了追踪方向"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4025.029, "timestamp": "01:07:05", "text": "就像注意力不集中一样。所以我不能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4027.91, "timestamp": "01:07:07", "text": "为这场圣诞直播做好充分准备"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4029.63, "timestamp": "01:07:09", "text": "是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4033.029, "timestamp": "01:07:13", "text": "虽然很痛，但我会尽力而为。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4043.19, "timestamp": "01:07:23", "text": "所以，呃，明天这个活动在哪儿？呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4045.91, "timestamp": "01:07:25", "text": "哦，对了，明天的日程安排。下周"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4049.99, "timestamp": "01:07:29", "text": "已经是下周了。十二月那一周"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4053.829, "timestamp": "01:07:33", "text": "25日至31日。就是下周。哦，等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4056.91, "timestamp": "01:07:36", "text": "哦，等等。等等，这周是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4060.029, "timestamp": "01:07:40", "text": "再次？ 1 2 3 4。这是第四个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4062.91, "timestamp": "01:07:42", "text": "12月的那一周。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4065.91, "timestamp": "01:07:45", "text": "所以，这将是最后一周……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4067.309, "timestamp": "01:07:47", "text": "香巴。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4070.349, "timestamp": "01:07:50", "text": "那么，我们应该玩哪些游戏呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4074.95, "timestamp": "01:07:54", "text": "星期？所以，有人建议我这么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4079.029, "timestamp": "01:07:59", "text": "专注于一款游戏两到三个月"}]